Subject: Ld.ld_so_diagnostics: key the cache by ::Pathname

Inside OS::Linux, a bare Pathname is OS::Linux::Pathname (the ClassMethods module), so the T.let named the wrong type.
---
--- a/Library/Homebrew/os/linux/ld.rb
+++ b/Library/Homebrew/os/linux/ld.rb
@@ -53,7 +53,7 @@
 
       sig { params(brewed: T::Boolean).returns(String) }
       def self.ld_so_diagnostics(brewed: true)
-        @ld_so_diagnostics ||= T.let({}, T.nilable(T::Hash[Pathname, T.nilable(String)]))
+        @ld_so_diagnostics ||= T.let({}, T.nilable(T::Hash[::Pathname, T.nilable(String)]))
 
         ld_so_target = if brewed
           ld_so = HOMEBREW_PREFIX/"lib/ld.so"
